### Actuator health
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### Get all repositories with security champion
GET http://localhost:8082/api/repositories/all

### Get security champions for a list of repositories
POST http://localhost:8082/api/securityChampion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repositoryNames": ["repo-one", "repo-two"]
}

### Set security champion for a single repository
POST http://localhost:8082/api/setSecurityChampion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repositoryName": "repo-one",
  "securityChampionEmail": "champion@example.com",
  "modifiedBy": "admin@example.com"
}

### Set security champion with no repository
POST http://localhost:8082/api/setSecurityChampionWithNoRepo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "securityChampionEmail": "champion@example.com",
  "modifiedBy": "admin@example.com"
}

### Set security champions for multiple repositories
POST http://localhost:8082/api/setSecurityChampions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repositoryNames": ["repo-one", "repo-two"],
  "securityChampionEmail": "champion@example.com",
  "modifiedBy": "admin@example.com"
}
